WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:06.151
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:06.421 --> 01:08.840
I forgot to bring your shirt.

3
01:10.235 --> 01:11.610
I don't care.

4
01:18.475 --> 01:20.092
I don't care anymore.

5
01:25.899 --> 01:30.034
I... But I've never done this before.

6
01:31.110 --> 01:32.821
Do you want to stop?

7
02:02.436 --> 02:05.094
I don't even know your name.

8
02:14.030 --> 02:15.616
Cho Yu Gyeom.

9
02:16.856 --> 02:20.814
[2. I Never Wanted to Die]

10
02:21.788 --> 02:26.614
[Episode 2] Honey, what's Pro Cho Ji Hyeon like?

11
02:26.614 --> 02:29.212
- So-so. - I see.

12
02:29.212 --> 02:35.407
I heard that family's a big deal around here.

13
02:36.188 --> 02:39.113
They say they're practically royalty.

14
02:39.831 --> 02:43.602
Well, he was pretty down-to-earth, though.

15
02:43.602 --> 02:45.314
Yeah.

16
02:45.314 --> 02:49.983
Oh, right. Jung Yeon, when do you have to go back to Seoul?

17
02:49.983 --> 02:51.426
The day after tomorrow.

18
02:51.426 --> 02:55.238
Then when you go, could you bring me what's in the fridge?

19
02:55.238 --> 02:58.283
I left some things there. I'm worried they'll spoil.

20
02:59.201 --> 03:01.119
- Jung Yeon? - Yes?

21
03:01.119 --> 03:03.415
- Where are you going? - To the fridge.

22
03:03.415 --> 03:06.265
Oh my. What's wrong with him?

23
03:06.265 --> 03:09.364
I mean the fridge at our house in Seoul, not this one.

24
03:10.281 --> 03:12.815
What's gotten into you?

25
03:12.815 --> 03:14.988
Didn't you sleep last night either?

26
03:15.926 --> 03:18.698
- I'm fine. - Honestly.

27
03:18.698 --> 03:20.605
You need sleep, or your body will...

28
03:20.605 --> 03:24.392
- Oh, Kim Ha Yeon. - Yeah?

29
03:24.392 --> 03:28.505
I signed you up for supplementary classes at the local school,

30
03:28.505 --> 03:31.942
so you can start going today.

31
03:31.942 --> 03:36.598
- What? - You kept going on about it.

32
03:36.598 --> 03:39.655
So you're telling me to go to school here now?

33
03:39.655 --> 03:43.495
Just the supplementary classes. That's all.

34
03:43.495 --> 03:46.647
- And that's at...? - One o'clock.

35
03:46.647 --> 03:50.522
Right. Just go to Upo High School by one o'clock.

36
03:50.522 --> 03:52.549
I already called them.

37
03:52.549 --> 03:56.723
Then go to the teachers' office. Take this.

38
03:59.052 --> 04:01.513
They have programs like that these days?

39
04:01.513 --> 04:05.292
Yes, apparently. Even kids from abroad can sign up.

40
04:05.292 --> 04:09.981
Seriously! Without even telling me!

41
04:09.981 --> 04:12.823
Seriously.

42
04:49.894 --> 04:51.521
Yu Gyeom!

43
04:52.564 --> 04:54.274
Cho Yu Gyeom!

44
04:56.772 --> 05:00.068
Come eat! Hurry, hurry!

45
05:35.690 --> 05:37.923
Cho Yu Gyeom.

46
05:37.923 --> 05:41.547
Did you run your father's errand yesterday?

47
05:43.415 --> 05:48.535
He did great, Father. Really great. Right, Yu Gyeom?

48
05:48.535 --> 05:51.287
Yes, Grandfather. It went just fine.

49
05:51.287 --> 05:53.812
What errand did you run?

50
05:55.960 --> 05:58.235
- Soy sauce... - Changnyeong!

51
06:09.224 --> 06:10.934
Yu Gyeom's mother.

52
06:10.934 --> 06:12.501
I want a word with you.

53
06:16.152 --> 06:21.814
If you can't even look after one child, how do you expect to be part of this family?

54
06:21.814 --> 06:23.183
Even now...

55
06:31.996 --> 06:35.959
I'm the one who lied, and you're the one who skipped out on it,

56
06:36.793 --> 06:40.220
but your grandfather's such a pain. Right?

57
06:41.756 --> 06:44.844
If he's that annoying, you should say something, Dad.

58
06:44.844 --> 06:48.930
Say, "Father, you're being quite a pain."

59
06:48.930 --> 06:51.583
No way. I'm scared.

60
07:05.530 --> 07:09.201
- Don't run. Hello. - Hello.

61
07:12.731 --> 07:16.058
- Hello - Hello.

62
07:20.501 --> 07:22.833
- Hello - Hello.

63
07:29.888 --> 07:36.061
Okay, listen up. Starting today, she'll join our supplementary classes for the vacation.

64
07:36.061 --> 07:38.043
Kim Ha Yeon.

65
07:44.152 --> 07:46.912
You could at least clap.

66
07:50.825 --> 07:53.537
You can sit in that empty seat over there.

67
08:01.586 --> 08:05.657
I'm taking attendance.

68
08:05.657 --> 08:08.577
- Goh Hui Jun. - Here.

69
08:08.577 --> 08:10.635
- Kim Gi Nam. - Here.

70
08:11.846 --> 08:14.349
- Kim Jin Mi. - Here.

71
08:14.349 --> 08:16.272
- Kim Hye Won. - Here.

72
08:16.272 --> 08:18.145
- Ryu Si Yeon. - Here.

73
08:19.187 --> 08:21.648
- Sung Sae Ryeong. - Here.

74
08:21.648 --> 08:23.900
Turn it all in by next class.

75
08:44.588 --> 08:46.695
Hey, what are you looking at?

76
08:54.764 --> 08:57.299
- Young master. - Cho Yu Gyeom.

77
08:57.299 --> 09:01.808
- Are you better at freestyle or butterfly? - I'm good at all of them.

78
09:21.082 --> 09:22.208
Hey, who's that?

79
09:22.208 --> 09:24.775
Wow, total attention seeker.

80
09:50.111 --> 09:51.677
I'm Cho Yu Gyeom.

81
09:53.072 --> 09:54.072
And you?

82
09:56.618 --> 09:58.996
I'm Kim Ha Yeon.

83
10:01.497 --> 10:03.111
What?

84
10:03.111 --> 10:05.944
Nothing. You have a pretty name.

85
10:16.930 --> 10:18.453
Cho Yu Gyeom!

86
10:19.188 --> 10:20.859
Wait for me!

87
10:25.398 --> 10:26.714
Do you know her?

88
10:56.397 --> 11:00.397
Kim Ha Yeon. I have to go out again for a bit.

89
11:00.397 --> 11:04.102
Get Jung Yeon some dinner. Kim Ha Yeon?

90
11:08.398 --> 11:10.171
Seriously. That girl.

91
11:55.445 --> 11:57.400
Thanks for giving it back.

92
11:59.824 --> 12:02.786
I didn't return it. I threw it away.

93
12:08.279 --> 12:12.087
I told you, I threw that away.

94
12:21.859 --> 12:23.931
What are you doing tonight?

95
12:23.931 --> 12:26.451
But you have a girlfriend, don't you?

96
12:26.451 --> 12:28.523
I asked what you're doing tonight!

97
12:30.049 --> 12:32.372
Go hang out with your girlfriend!

98
12:33.357 --> 12:35.642
My girlfriend's going to hang out with you?

99
12:35.642 --> 12:40.113
No! I mean you should hang out with her!

100
13:33.960 --> 13:37.269
But why did you do that with me when you have a girlfriend?

101
13:37.922 --> 13:39.866
You approached me first.

102
13:40.545 --> 13:45.903
So even with a girlfriend, you let anyone who makes a move get close?

103
13:50.768 --> 13:51.912
Who knows?

104
13:52.571 --> 13:54.355
"Who knows"?

105
13:54.355 --> 13:56.149
Yeah. Who knows.

106
13:58.442 --> 14:00.695
Seriously. You crazy bastard!

107
14:00.695 --> 14:02.964
- Hey! - What?

108
14:09.370 --> 14:11.386
Take this. It's yours.

109
14:18.963 --> 14:21.215
How did you find this?

110
14:21.215 --> 14:23.049
In the sea.

111
14:23.049 --> 14:24.302
What?

112
14:24.302 --> 14:27.355
I dried it off. You can try turning it on tomorrow morning.

113
14:27.355 --> 14:30.607
But since it fell in the sea, it might be a little corroded.

114
14:37.148 --> 14:39.843
Okay. Thanks.

115
14:42.236 --> 14:43.905
What are you doing tonight?

116
14:46.089 --> 14:48.006
I want to see you, okay?

117
14:49.911 --> 14:52.274
Want to meet here at 9:30 p.m.?

118
14:52.274 --> 14:53.915
No!

119
14:53.915 --> 14:55.548
I'll wait!

120
14:55.548 --> 14:57.653
I said no!

121
14:57.653 --> 14:59.400
Until you come!

122
14:59.400 --> 15:01.422
I said no!

123
15:12.141 --> 15:14.393
How did you find this?

124
15:14.393 --> 15:15.834
In the sea.

125
16:12.076 --> 16:15.206
What do you think? Want to go in together?

126
16:36.073 --> 16:37.768
No.

127
16:37.768 --> 16:38.820
Okay.

128
16:40.520 --> 16:42.188
I'll get going then.

129
16:55.286 --> 16:58.707
I dreamed I was with you.

130
16:59.582 --> 17:03.045
But in the dream, I knew it was a dream.

131
17:35.576 --> 17:37.569
I want to see you, okay?

132
17:37.569 --> 17:39.686
Want to meet here at 9:30 p.m.?

133
17:42.751 --> 17:46.138
Hey, Mom wants you to come out.

134
17:48.464 --> 17:49.897
What are you doing?

135
18:10.027 --> 18:13.699
Did you see the text Mom sent you yesterday?

136
18:14.448 --> 18:15.684
No.

137
18:15.684 --> 18:17.040
Why not?

138
18:18.327 --> 18:20.664
My phone fell in the sea.

139
18:21.622 --> 18:23.096
What?

140
18:23.096 --> 18:25.176
It'll turn on tomorrow, I guess.

141
18:27.628 --> 18:30.924
Kim Ha Yeon. What's gotten into you lately?

142
18:30.924 --> 18:32.180
What did I do?

143
18:32.180 --> 18:37.657
Why do you keep talking back? And you never listen.

144
18:37.657 --> 18:41.139
You yell at everything I say, and you go out without telling me.

145
18:44.772 --> 18:51.719
Is this because I said you work hard, but you'll never amount to anything?

146
18:52.821 --> 18:53.940
Mom.

147
18:53.940 --> 18:55.989
Honestly.

148
18:55.989 --> 18:59.148
But, Ha Yeon, it's true.

149
19:01.120 --> 19:04.545
- What did you say? - So work harder.

150
19:04.545 --> 19:08.480
Find the drive to become something and set a clear goal.

151
19:08.480 --> 19:10.921
Like your brother.

152
19:10.921 --> 19:14.501
Your brother had a clear goal, didn't he?

153
19:14.501 --> 19:16.939
He'd get into one of the top three, SKY, no matter what.

154
19:16.939 --> 19:19.753
Then he'd get good grades and join a big company.

155
19:19.753 --> 19:23.172
That's a clear, concrete goal.

156
19:23.770 --> 19:28.315
All I'm saying is, set a goal like that, too.

157
19:28.315 --> 19:31.123
Then I can support you, too.

158
19:31.123 --> 19:36.354
If you just drift along, day after day,

159
19:37.823 --> 19:42.453
with every day the same as the last,

160
19:42.453 --> 19:46.104
you'll never become anything.

161
19:46.104 --> 19:47.305
Understand?

162
19:49.793 --> 19:50.969
Ha Yeon.

163
19:50.969 --> 19:54.538
I'm only saying this because I care.

164
19:55.429 --> 19:57.480
It's all for your own good.

165
19:57.480 --> 20:02.147
But you take it the wrong way and get all sulky.

166
20:02.147 --> 20:03.538
Yes, Mom.

167
20:05.397 --> 20:06.685
What?

168
20:06.685 --> 20:09.349
Fine. I'll live my life your way, Mom.

169
20:09.349 --> 20:11.029
So you're going to set a goal?

170
20:11.029 --> 20:13.595
Yes, yes. I'll try setting a goal or something.

171
20:13.595 --> 20:16.987
Good. Good, Ha Yeon.

172
20:16.987 --> 20:23.661
Okay, so, first, make a daily schedule and give it to me.

173
20:23.661 --> 20:27.878
Well, then, Mom, I'll be going for a walk to clear my head.

174
20:27.878 --> 20:32.683
You said you'd set a goal, so why are you suddenly going for a walk?

175
20:39.927 --> 20:41.829
Ha Yeon!

176
21:25.472 --> 21:27.108
Hey, did you see her?

177
21:32.689 --> 21:36.817
I heard she's from Seoul. Do you know her?

178
21:36.817 --> 21:38.694
No.

179
21:38.694 --> 21:42.489
But it looks like she fell for you the second she got here.

180
21:42.489 --> 21:44.414
She knows what's good.

181
21:44.414 --> 21:46.355
Yeah, of course.

182
21:46.355 --> 21:48.709
Cho Yu Gyeom's looks are world-class.

183
21:48.709 --> 21:51.151
Hey, I'm at that level too. World-class?

184
21:51.151 --> 21:53.959
You're at that level. Economy class.

185
21:53.959 --> 21:56.505
He's at that level. World-class.

186
21:56.505 --> 21:58.479
Are you crazy, Lee Won Bae?

187
22:00.981 --> 22:02.312
Cho Yu Gyeom.

188
22:03.169 --> 22:05.948
You're meeting me at midnight tonight, right?

189
22:07.820 --> 22:14.103
But who knows? Maybe today is the day you get to do what you want.

190
22:18.317 --> 22:20.362
Jin Mi, wait for me!

191
22:42.769 --> 22:44.659
You were here?

192
22:55.604 --> 22:59.400
But this is kind of scary.

193
22:59.400 --> 23:02.543
It's fine. I've got you.

194
23:02.543 --> 23:05.698
No, but I don't think I can do it.

195
23:05.698 --> 23:08.257
Then just close your eyes.

196
23:09.064 --> 23:11.994
Why can't we just go into the sea from the beach?

197
23:12.579 --> 23:14.456
Didn't you say you can't swim?

198
23:14.456 --> 23:16.289
Yeah, I can't.

199
23:16.289 --> 23:20.443
Then you definitely can't. The waves there are no joke at night.

200
23:22.297 --> 23:24.910
Then why is jumping down here okay?

201
23:24.910 --> 23:26.114
Big waves here, too.

202
23:26.114 --> 23:30.903
There are no waves down there. It's totally safe as long as you jump.

203
24:41.335 --> 24:42.429
Hey...

204
24:44.433 --> 24:46.173
Let go of this so you can float.

205
24:46.173 --> 24:49.620
No... I'm just too scared.

206
24:50.886 --> 24:52.120
Just try letting go.

207
24:52.120 --> 24:53.981
- I'll help you. - How?

208
24:53.981 --> 24:55.835
Wait a second.

209
25:03.524 --> 25:07.741
It's because we're lighter than the water.

210
25:09.873 --> 25:11.514
Look at the sky.

211
25:14.952 --> 25:17.990
It's always like this around here.

212
25:20.573 --> 25:22.426
Seoul isn't like this.

213
25:34.304 --> 25:36.224
Kim Ha Yeon.

214
25:36.224 --> 25:37.242
Yeah?

215
25:41.023 --> 25:42.292
Never mind.

216
25:44.606 --> 25:46.026
What is it?

217
25:47.943 --> 25:49.505
Nothing.

218
25:51.397 --> 25:53.323
I wanted to say thanks for coming.

219
25:53.323 --> 25:56.063
Seriously.

220
25:59.121 --> 26:01.623
- What? - Don't let go, don't let go. I'm sorry,

221
26:01.623 --> 26:04.627
I'm sorry. Don't let go. I'm so sorry.

222
26:26.189 --> 26:27.343
It's me.

223
26:28.439 --> 26:30.939
Have you seen Cho Yu Gyeom today?

224
26:30.939 --> 26:32.705
No. Not since school ended.

225
26:33.502 --> 26:36.793
Where's Cho Yu Gyeom now? Is he home?

226
26:36.793 --> 26:40.066
Not sure. I haven't seen him since school.

227
26:40.066 --> 26:43.040
Has he been in touch? Did you go to his house?

228
26:43.040 --> 26:46.460
No? I asked to meet tonight, but he said he had something to do.

229
26:46.460 --> 26:47.981
Didn't he?

230
26:47.981 --> 26:49.023
Yeah. Why?

231
26:50.796 --> 26:52.122
What was it?

232
26:52.122 --> 26:53.904
Wasn't he meeting you?

233
26:55.233 --> 26:56.637
Why? What's going on?

234
26:56.637 --> 26:58.273
Sung Sae Ryeong didn't see Cho Yu Gyeom?

235
26:58.273 --> 26:59.846
Seems so.

236
26:59.846 --> 27:04.955
Maybe his grandpa caught him trying to sneak out.

237
27:04.955 --> 27:07.777
Or he fell off his bike and croaked.

238
27:14.313 --> 27:15.374
Look.

239
27:16.503 --> 27:18.048
Is this Cho Yu Gyeom's?

240
27:18.048 --> 27:19.480
Yeah.

241
27:19.480 --> 27:21.620
Shin Seung Chan!

242
27:21.620 --> 27:24.855
Hold on. Go check by the sea.

243
27:24.855 --> 27:27.952
What a pain, seriously.

244
27:30.147 --> 27:32.218
Are you here? Cho Yu Gyeom? You here?

245
27:33.369 --> 27:35.049
No, he's not here.

246
27:36.269 --> 27:38.033
He's not really dead, is he?

247
27:38.033 --> 27:40.025
Idiot. Hey.

248
27:40.025 --> 27:43.353
He might fall and die, but drown? That guy's like a seal.

249
27:43.353 --> 27:47.973
What happened? What was it?

250
27:47.973 --> 27:51.853
Well, I'm at the cliff, and only Cho Yu Gyeom's shoes are here.

251
27:51.853 --> 27:52.873
What?

252
27:53.542 --> 27:56.488
- What is it? What? - What's wrong?

253
27:56.488 --> 27:57.698
What's this?

254
27:57.698 --> 28:00.533
What do you think? Sneakers.

255
28:00.533 --> 28:03.155
Don't you see? These aren't Cho Yu Gyeom's.

256
28:05.622 --> 28:07.502
You're right.

257
28:07.502 --> 28:08.509
I see.

258
28:10.573 --> 28:13.513
There's another pair of shoes next to Cho Yu Gyeom's here.

259
28:13.513 --> 28:14.810
What?

260
28:15.632 --> 28:17.135
Whose are they?

261
28:17.135 --> 28:18.648
I don't know either.

262
28:18.648 --> 28:21.662
- Whose could they be? - I'm asking whose they are!

263
28:21.662 --> 28:25.113
How should I know just from the sneakers?

264
28:25.113 --> 28:27.626
230 mm.

265
28:28.770 --> 28:33.066
230. Isn't this a girl's size?

266
28:33.066 --> 28:34.526
Is 230 always a girl's size?

267
28:34.526 --> 28:38.600
Right. Hardly any guys wear a 230.

268
28:40.615 --> 28:43.328
Take a picture of that and send it right now.

269
28:46.913 --> 28:49.554
Which crazy bitch was with Cho Yu Gyeom?

270
28:50.887 --> 28:54.633
Roll call, everyone. Send proof of where you are, right now.

271
28:54.633 --> 28:59.004
- Sae Ryeong, why? What's going on? - I'm home.

272
28:59.004 --> 29:02.187
- Me too. - I'm home.

273
29:02.187 --> 29:04.310
I'm at my grandma's.

274
29:05.390 --> 29:07.809
Who wears a size 230 shoe?

275
29:07.809 --> 29:09.911
I'm a 235.

276
29:09.911 --> 29:10.979
Me too.

277
29:10.979 --> 29:13.523
I'm a 225.

278
29:13.523 --> 29:15.509
I'm a 240.

279
29:15.509 --> 29:19.293
I'm a 230, but I'm home.

280
29:19.293 --> 29:20.993
Any other bitch missing?

281
29:21.782 --> 29:24.213
One person isn't answering.

282
29:24.213 --> 29:26.705
Someone hasn't read it. Who is it?

283
29:29.133 --> 29:31.981
I think it's Na Gyeong. Lee Na Gyeong.

284
29:31.981 --> 29:34.044
It is Na Gyeong.

285
29:34.044 --> 29:36.588
Why isn't Lee Na Gyeong answering?

286
29:36.588 --> 29:39.522
Isn't Na Gyeong a size 230?

287
29:39.522 --> 29:41.968
I'm home. What's up with Na Gyeong?

288
29:41.968 --> 29:44.137
Are these Lee Na Gyeong's shoes?

289
29:44.137 --> 29:47.281
They look like hers.

290
29:47.281 --> 29:49.309
I think so, too, Sae Ryeong.

291
29:49.309 --> 29:51.981
Lee Na Gyeong, answer me.

292
29:51.981 --> 29:54.198
Lee Na Gyeong, where are you? Lee Na Gyeong!

293
30:20.704 --> 30:23.707
I've never had a boyfriend.

294
30:25.095 --> 30:26.181
Yeah.

295
30:27.472 --> 30:32.213
So I don't know what this is. I don't know what this feeling is.

296
30:32.213 --> 30:34.007
But you know.

297
30:36.605 --> 30:38.935
You have a girlfriend, after all.

298
30:40.107 --> 30:41.321
Right?

299
30:43.697 --> 30:46.131
No. I don't know either.

300
30:46.131 --> 30:47.138
What?

301
30:48.845 --> 30:50.667
It's just that you're you.

302
30:53.065 --> 30:54.723
But to someone like me,

303
30:56.418 --> 30:57.690
you came.

304
31:02.865 --> 31:04.191
You came.

305
31:13.029 --> 31:15.669
That's right. I...

306
31:39.449 --> 31:41.245
[Upo High School]

307
31:41.245 --> 31:42.848
Wait for me!

308
32:09.355 --> 32:11.188
It wasn't me, Sae Ryeong.

309
32:11.188 --> 32:13.787
Then why didn't you send proof?

310
32:13.787 --> 32:16.564
Exactly. Right?

311
32:16.564 --> 32:20.585
I was sleeping. It was past midnight, so...

312
32:20.585 --> 32:23.545
Don't you know you have to get up when I call everyone?

313
32:23.545 --> 32:26.952
But I was asleep. What could I do?

314
32:26.952 --> 32:28.798
I was just so tired.

315
32:28.798 --> 32:30.828
No. You weren't asleep.

316
32:30.828 --> 32:32.815
No. I was asleep.

317
32:33.473 --> 32:35.390
What were you doing with my Yu Gyeom?

318
32:36.351 --> 32:41.027
No, really. I didn't see him. Sae Ryeong, he'd never want to meet me anyway.

319
32:42.190 --> 32:45.545
You know, Na Gyeong, kings in the old days

320
32:45.545 --> 32:50.557
would sometimes reject a perfectly good wife and take some nobody as a concubine, you know?

321
32:52.280 --> 32:56.981
Look at me. What good is it being such a perfect wife to Yu Gyeom?

322
32:56.981 --> 32:58.621
He says he gets sick of me sometimes.

323
32:58.621 --> 33:02.259
No! It wasn't me! Really!

324
33:04.504 --> 33:06.172
Look at this.

325
33:06.172 --> 33:09.259
Your sneakers are right there in the photo, so how dare you lie?

326
33:09.259 --> 33:13.724
No. Really. It wasn't me. My sneakers...

327
33:15.369 --> 33:19.605
Look. Mine don't have this. Really. These aren't mine.

328
33:19.605 --> 33:23.125
- You must've worked damn hard erasing it. - No! I said no!

329
33:23.125 --> 33:28.320
Got proof? Do you? If not, a witness?

330
33:28.320 --> 33:33.963
Your Vietnamese mom ran off ages ago, and your dad was out on a boat, not at home.

331
33:33.963 --> 33:38.668
Do you have any proof or a witness that you were home at that time?

332
33:38.668 --> 33:40.269
Answer me!

333
33:41.605 --> 33:46.516
- Eyes down. How dare you... - No! It wasn't me!

334
33:54.665 --> 33:56.763
- Kim Gi Nam. - Here.

335
33:57.349 --> 33:59.851
- Kim Jin Mi. - Here.

336
33:59.851 --> 34:02.034
- Kim Hye Won. - Here.

337
34:03.396 --> 34:06.107
- Ryu Si Yeon. - Here.

338
34:06.107 --> 34:08.545
- Sung Sae Ryeong. - Here.

339
34:08.545 --> 34:10.585
- Oh Yun Beom. - Here.

340
34:11.467 --> 34:13.172
Lee Na Gyeong.

341
34:15.077 --> 34:16.509
Lee Na Gyeong.

342
34:18.078 --> 34:19.811
Lee Na Gyeong isn't here?

343
34:26.355 --> 34:31.125
Um... Sir. Na Gyeong went home.

344
34:31.125 --> 34:33.635
What? When?

345
34:34.594 --> 34:36.021
She...

346
34:36.654 --> 34:39.557
she said she wasn't feeling well.

347
34:39.557 --> 34:41.867
That brat left without telling me.

348
34:44.521 --> 34:47.565
- Lee Hyeon Jin. - Here.

349
34:47.565 --> 34:50.323
- Lee Il Ho. - Here.

350
34:50.323 --> 34:52.094
Watch out for Sung Sae Ryeong.

351
34:53.467 --> 34:54.498
Why?

352
34:57.096 --> 34:59.716
Why? Because she's your girlfriend?

353
35:00.564 --> 35:01.647
No.

354
35:02.465 --> 35:03.465
Then why?

355
35:05.834 --> 35:08.115
Just be careful around her.

356
35:09.673 --> 35:12.039
She looked really pretty, though.

357
35:14.300 --> 35:18.245
I thought that's all she was, too.

358
35:21.085 --> 35:22.232
But?

359
35:35.363 --> 35:38.587
Phenomena that occur without human values

360
35:38.587 --> 35:42.888
or will are called natural phenomena.

361
35:42.888 --> 35:46.571
Their features: first, value neutrality.

362
35:46.571 --> 35:49.607
Second, they follow the laws of existence.

363
35:49.607 --> 35:55.994
Third, cause and effect are clear, so principles of certainty and necessity apply.

364
35:55.994 --> 36:01.025
Fourth, they produce the same results under the same conditions.

365
36:01.025 --> 36:06.710
Fifth, they are far more universal than social and cultural phenomena.

366
36:07.729 --> 36:13.026
Social and cultural phenomena here refer to social activities between people,

367
36:13.026 --> 36:17.155
that is, all human social behavior and attitudes.

368
36:17.155 --> 36:19.824
They are diverse and complex in themselves,

369
36:19.824 --> 36:24.746
and appear in many different ways depending on how people view them,

370
36:24.746 --> 36:27.692
and these also have four characteristics.

371
36:27.692 --> 36:30.564
First, value-ladenness.

372
36:34.007 --> 36:35.905
Hey! Wait! Wait!

373
36:35.905 --> 36:37.426
- Come on. - Hurry up.

374
36:51.481 --> 36:53.110
Wait for me!

375
36:56.395 --> 36:58.555
Why couldn't you come yesterday?

376
37:00.073 --> 37:02.105
I waited for you.

377
37:02.105 --> 37:03.355
Yeah.

378
37:28.101 --> 37:29.479
Cho Yu Gyeom?

379
37:31.148 --> 37:32.273
Yeah.

380
37:34.941 --> 37:38.949
No, I was just thinking how handsome you are. My boyfriend.

381
37:49.664 --> 37:52.917
Find out where that new Seoul bitch lives. Now.

382
37:52.917 --> 37:55.692
What kind of bullshit is this? What is this?

383
37:56.462 --> 37:59.132
Seoul bitch? Who's that?

384
37:59.132 --> 38:02.051
- The kid in our supplementary class. - What?

385
38:02.051 --> 38:03.647
The one from Seoul.

386
38:03.647 --> 38:07.589
What? Why? What's going on? What's this? Seoul bitch?

387
38:07.589 --> 38:10.768
Look at Sung Sae Ryeong's KakaoTalk.

388
38:10.768 --> 38:12.312
Her name's Kim Ha Yeon.

389
38:12.312 --> 38:14.439
She's from Seoul.

390
38:14.439 --> 38:16.052
So where does she live?

391
38:16.052 --> 38:18.943
Su Jin says she lives at the golf course.

392
38:18.943 --> 38:21.568
The golf course? Is there housing there?

393
38:21.568 --> 38:23.558
Maybe she lives in a bunker?

394
38:23.558 --> 38:26.309
Apparently, her dad is Cho Ji Hyeon's caddie.

395
38:26.309 --> 38:29.162
Hey, I found out where Kim Ha Yeon lives.

396
38:29.162 --> 38:30.188
Bruh.

397
38:30.188 --> 38:32.911
The exit's over there.

398
38:36.275 --> 38:39.235
Seriously.

399
38:39.235 --> 38:41.315
Let's go over there.

400
38:41.315 --> 38:44.359
It's Upo Country Club Mansion, Building B, Unit 202.

401
39:36.562 --> 39:38.731
Cho Yu Gyeom, come here. I think I'll be a star.

402
39:38.731 --> 39:40.986
This is hilarious. Come quickly.

403
39:43.755 --> 39:48.784
- You saw that? Did you see it? - What is this?

404
40:00.105 --> 40:03.980
I'm becoming a top star, I swear. Look at me. I'm about to be a star.

405
40:08.594 --> 40:10.855
Tonight, 9:30, the lighthouse.

406
40:10.855 --> 40:14.517
You mean it's big.

407
40:15.896 --> 40:17.095
Right?

408
40:19.159 --> 40:21.127
Yeah. I'm going to bed.

409
40:53.556 --> 40:54.685
Hey!

410
40:56.100 --> 40:57.281
Where are you going?

411
41:00.646 --> 41:04.278
I asked where you're going at this hour.

412
41:08.613 --> 41:11.661
Just... to get some air.

413
41:11.661 --> 41:14.035
I felt like taking a walk.

414
41:14.035 --> 41:15.657
What are you, a puppy?

415
41:17.379 --> 41:22.135
Why do you always go for a walk at this time?

416
41:22.135 --> 41:24.576
Just... it's kind of hot.

417
41:24.576 --> 41:26.149
It's hotter outside.

418
41:26.149 --> 41:28.860
No, my room's hotter.

419
41:28.860 --> 41:32.797
Only Jung Yeon's room and yours have AC, but mine doesn't.

420
41:33.816 --> 41:36.475
- What? - Anyway, I'll be back.

421
41:36.475 --> 41:37.849
Kim Ha Yeon.

422
41:38.655 --> 41:43.171
Since when did you start talking back to everything I say?

423
41:44.482 --> 41:50.313
I'm not talking back. You asked, so I just answered.

424
41:52.573 --> 41:56.035
You know we're not done talking, right?

425
42:00.665 --> 42:03.308
Then come over here and sit down.

426
42:05.215 --> 42:08.732
But, Mom... where's Jung Yeon?

427
42:09.674 --> 42:11.495
Jung Yeon went to Seoul, remember?

428
42:11.495 --> 42:15.662
Yeah? Then I'll go get some air, too.

429
42:16.853 --> 42:18.314
What's that supposed to mean...

430
42:20.115 --> 42:21.978
Aren't you going to study?

431
42:21.978 --> 42:25.605
You said you'd study and go to college. You said it yourself.

432
42:25.605 --> 42:28.818
You said it didn't matter whether someone like me studied or not.

433
42:28.818 --> 42:30.758
So I decided not to.

434
42:32.916 --> 42:35.449
Seriously. Ha Yeon. You really...

435
42:35.449 --> 42:38.163
- I'll be right back. - Seriously, you.

436
43:02.602 --> 43:04.110
Kim Ha Yeon!

437
43:13.070 --> 43:14.157
Hi.

438
43:19.160 --> 43:22.708
You're Kim Ha Yeon, right?

439
43:28.123 --> 43:29.671
Where are you going?

440
43:35.343 --> 43:37.517
I was just going to get some air.

441
43:38.387 --> 43:39.478
Really?

442
43:40.681 --> 43:44.247
Before you get some air, why don't we talk for a bit?

443
44:11.379 --> 44:12.633
Excuse me.

444
44:17.718 --> 44:19.348
Where is this?

445
44:20.343 --> 44:24.837
Where do you think? It's the place where you and I will have a little talk.

446
44:27.903 --> 44:30.258
Could you just say it here, then?

447
44:30.258 --> 44:31.346
What did you say?

448
44:32.143 --> 44:33.703
What?

449
44:33.703 --> 44:36.653
I said don't go any farther. Just talk here.

450
44:44.912 --> 44:48.099
Fine. We'll do it here, then.

451
44:54.922 --> 44:57.302
What were you doing with Yu Gyeom last night?

452
44:58.676 --> 45:01.109
What were you doing? With my boyfriend.

453
45:02.183 --> 45:03.931
I didn't do anything...

454
45:03.931 --> 45:05.834
Yes, you did.

455
45:05.834 --> 45:10.897
More than a few people saw you two take off your shoes and crawl into the sea.

456
45:13.065 --> 45:16.103
- We just swam... - No.

457
45:16.103 --> 45:18.996
You did more. I know.

458
45:19.743 --> 45:21.096
What did you do?

459
45:21.954 --> 45:23.909
I said I did nothing.

460
45:23.909 --> 45:27.420
You said you swam. Is swimming nothing?

461
45:29.707 --> 45:31.260
Do you even know Cho Yu Gyeom?

462
45:32.468 --> 45:33.785
Do you?

463
45:35.382 --> 45:37.708
- Well... - Fuck.

464
45:38.330 --> 45:43.030
You should've said from the start you didn't know him, you crazy bitch.

465
45:44.294 --> 45:45.743
What?

466
45:45.743 --> 45:47.363
I'm not a crazy bitch.

467
45:47.363 --> 45:50.936
- What? You're a crazy bitch to me. - No. I'm not a crazy bitch.

468
45:50.936 --> 45:53.091
If not a crazy bitch, what do you want to be?

469
45:53.091 --> 45:54.546
A moron?

470
45:58.444 --> 46:00.518
What answer do you want?

471
46:00.518 --> 46:03.699
Just tell the truth. Just. The. Truth.

472
46:06.923 --> 46:08.375
We kissed.

473
46:09.872 --> 46:11.373
No.

474
46:11.373 --> 46:13.793
- Not that. - What?

475
46:13.793 --> 46:17.453
You did more than that. Just say that.

476
46:17.453 --> 46:19.882
Then I'll forgive you, okay?

477
46:19.882 --> 46:22.003
But I didn't do anything more than that.

478
46:22.003 --> 46:26.013
No. You did more. Tell me. Now.

479
46:26.013 --> 46:29.111
No, nothing more. We just kissed.

480
46:29.111 --> 46:32.843
- And? - I told you. We swam. In the sea.

481
46:32.843 --> 46:34.057
And?

482
46:35.940 --> 46:37.511
We held hands.

483
46:37.511 --> 46:38.522
What?

484
46:38.522 --> 46:41.147
I said we held hands. We swam holding hands.

485
46:42.509 --> 46:44.794
What else? What else? Tell me.

486
46:46.700 --> 46:47.788
Talking.

487
46:50.802 --> 46:52.217
We talked.

488
46:57.197 --> 46:58.865
What did you talk about?

489
46:59.503 --> 47:02.319
Just talking. About me, about him. And--

490
47:02.319 --> 47:06.982
Not that! You did more than that. Tell me that!

491
47:07.888 --> 47:10.307
No. We didn't do more.

492
47:10.307 --> 47:14.402
We met, held hands, talked, swam, kissed. That's all. And...

493
47:16.683 --> 47:19.447
Cho Yu Gyeom said he won't break up with you.

494
47:21.129 --> 47:23.809
He said he won't. Not even if it kills him.

495
47:25.787 --> 47:26.863
Why?

496
47:29.660 --> 47:31.957
He said you know the reason, too.

497
47:33.311 --> 47:36.959
No? I don't.

498
47:36.959 --> 47:39.994
Why would he play with another bitch when I'm his girlfriend,

499
47:39.994 --> 47:42.153
and say he won't break up with me?

500
47:43.757 --> 47:45.212
Tell me.

501
47:51.823 --> 47:53.080
I'm scared.

502
47:56.443 --> 47:58.428
So I can't break up with her.

503
48:01.192 --> 48:02.925
Sung Sae Ryeong is just so...

504
48:04.195 --> 48:06.030
He's scared of you.

505
48:06.030 --> 48:07.680
Fuck.

506
48:08.595 --> 48:09.950
He said you're pretty.

507
48:09.950 --> 48:11.285
He liked you for it. But--

508
48:11.285 --> 48:13.647
Fuck! Did you hold his hand first?

509
48:13.647 --> 48:16.981
You held it first, didn't you? And while you were talking, he fell asleep.

510
48:16.981 --> 48:20.984
He just got sleepy and dozed off, right? Without even listening to you.

511
48:21.787 --> 48:23.037
No.

512
48:24.017 --> 48:25.565
Cho Yu Gyeom held my hand first.

513
48:25.565 --> 48:28.427
Cho Yu Gyeom asked me all sorts of questions, too. And--

514
48:28.427 --> 48:29.442
Stop.

515
48:30.618 --> 48:32.258
Stop it.

516
48:32.258 --> 48:34.303
You asked first.

517
48:39.688 --> 48:41.485
Aren't I just so pretty?

518
48:43.776 --> 48:47.112
- What? - I'm damn pretty.

519
48:47.112 --> 48:49.114
And you must have heard the rumors about me.

520
48:49.114 --> 48:52.107
Whose kid I am and where I live. Right?

521
48:55.207 --> 48:56.543
I've heard.

522
48:57.176 --> 49:01.696
Then I'll tell you a very interesting story.

523
49:02.631 --> 49:03.856
Listen carefully.

524
49:06.382 --> 49:11.409
Because I'm going to kill you today.

525
49:12.827 --> 49:14.078
What did you say?

526
49:15.557 --> 49:20.187
My house is that three-story house at the foot of the mountain over there, okay?

527
49:22.856 --> 49:25.442
Actually, that's not my house.

528
49:25.442 --> 49:29.195
What was it again? A villa some lawmaker uses, I think?

529
49:29.195 --> 49:32.007
There's an old man there who looks after the place.

530
49:32.692 --> 49:35.869
I got kind of close to him.

531
49:35.869 --> 49:39.592
So I go in and out of there and clean it for him.

532
49:39.592 --> 49:41.125
What do you mean?

533
49:41.125 --> 49:42.973
What do I mean?

534
49:42.973 --> 49:47.405
The house everyone thinks is mine isn't mine.

535
49:48.299 --> 49:53.717
And my real house

536
49:53.717 --> 49:55.806
is farther in from there.

537
49:55.806 --> 49:58.776
It's a fucking tumbledown shack.

538
49:59.602 --> 50:03.175
I live there. With who?

539
50:03.175 --> 50:06.191
With my grandma, who can't hear or speak.

540
50:06.191 --> 50:10.385
How about that? I'm pitiful, aren't I?

541
50:14.658 --> 50:16.785
But the kids don't know.

542
50:16.785 --> 50:20.657
They just think my dad's a lawmaker somewhere else.

543
50:22.082 --> 50:27.046
They think my mom went off to support Dad and left me here alone,

544
50:27.046 --> 50:31.592
but actually, my dad's... in a gambling den.

545
50:31.592 --> 50:35.227
What does anyone do in a gambling den? Gamble.

546
50:35.971 --> 50:40.940
And my real mom ran away.

547
50:41.852 --> 50:47.482
She remarried some other guy and abandoned me long ago.

548
50:51.904 --> 50:56.617
That's why I need Cho Yu Gyeom.

549
50:56.617 --> 51:01.121
Because Cho Yu Gyeom is my jackpot.

550
51:01.121 --> 51:04.083
- A jackpot? - Yeah. A jackpot.

551
51:04.083 --> 51:09.046
Because he'll never take a single step out of this town his whole life.

552
51:09.046 --> 51:13.571
Oh! Then I'm the perfect match.

553
51:13.571 --> 51:17.887
Of course he knows nothing about me. But it doesn't matter.

554
51:17.887 --> 51:22.566
Because all I have to do is marry into his family and have a son.

555
51:24.228 --> 51:26.030
What about Cho Yu Gyeom?

556
51:26.030 --> 51:30.255
He can't break up because he's scared of me? That's even better.

557
51:30.255 --> 51:33.529
Then we'll just never break up.

558
51:33.529 --> 51:35.639
Then I'm happy I got my jackpot,

559
51:35.639 --> 51:38.543
and he's happy to have the prettiest girl in our town.

560
51:38.543 --> 51:43.772
You see, we'll save each other that way.

561
51:43.772 --> 51:45.833
In a future without you.

562
51:51.547 --> 51:52.801
No.

563
51:54.341 --> 51:58.089
He might save you, but I don't think you can save him.

564
51:58.089 --> 51:59.130
What?

565
51:59.130 --> 52:03.934
That's because he's a jackpot to you, but you're a losing ticket to him.

566
52:03.934 --> 52:07.872
What are you saying, you psycho? And here I was, letting you live.

567
52:08.634 --> 52:10.517
And Cho Yu Gyeom,

568
52:12.401 --> 52:14.058
I'll save him.

569
52:14.058 --> 52:16.233
He'll save me, too.

570
52:17.197 --> 52:18.897
Shut up!

571
52:36.925 --> 52:40.085
How dare you just show up out of nowhere!

572
53:54.545 --> 53:57.217
I never wanted to die.

573
54:01.587 --> 54:03.268
119, what's your emergency?

574
54:04.805 --> 54:06.147
Hello?

575
54:06.147 --> 54:11.478
- Excuse me... someone's dead here. - Yes.

576
54:11.478 --> 54:13.105
What? Where are you?

577
54:13.105 --> 54:17.384
There's some kind of warehouse here. It's a path along the rice paddies.

578
54:17.384 --> 54:19.236
I can see a road far off, too.

579
54:19.236 --> 54:23.994
Hello. Is the patient conscious and breathing? Is the breathing normal?

580
54:25.784 --> 54:27.716
- There's blood... - Hello?

581
54:27.716 --> 54:29.788
coming from the head... so much...

582
54:29.788 --> 54:31.794
Hello? Can you hear me?

583
54:32.583 --> 54:33.989
Hello?

584
54:35.447 --> 54:40.591
I just liked movies and believed in fate,

585
54:40.591 --> 54:45.623
and waited for my rich birth mother and a prince on a white horse.

586
54:46.522 --> 54:49.188
I wanted to be just a notch above my brother,

587
54:49.188 --> 54:54.706
to say a single "no" to the friends who bully me,

588
54:55.805 --> 54:58.679
to try having a boyfriend like everyone else,

589
54:58.679 --> 55:04.672
and to get into a car accident, but only get a little hurt.

590
55:09.328 --> 55:11.723
And so summer came,

591
55:18.935 --> 55:21.254
and I came here,

592
55:22.739 --> 55:24.825
and that's really all I am.

593
55:28.439 --> 55:33.912
I never wanted to kill anyone.

594
55:36.438 --> 55:40.794
In this brilliant summer vacation.
